---
import { BOOKING_URL, CTA_PRIMARY } from '../lib/links';
---

<section id="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Automation &amp; Systems Consulting · Kansas City</div>
    <h1 class="title title--hero hero-h1">Systems that run your business without you.</h1>
    <p class="lede hero-lede">I help small businesses optimize and scale — automating the repetitive work, connecting the tools that don’t talk to each other, and building systems that keep running when you’re not in the room.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href={BOOKING_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--primary">
        {CTA_PRIMARY}
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn--link">See the work →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">The first call is free — I'll find you at least 5 hours a week back, or tell you straight there's nothing worth building.</p>
    <p class="hero-note hero-proof-line">Nine years building production software in healthcare, fintech, and government work — now systems for small businesses and local organizations in Kansas City.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-6); }
  .hero-lede { margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
  .hero-note { margin-top: var(--space-5); font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: 54ch; }
  .hero-proof-line { margin-top: var(--space-8); }
</style>
